  'alofresh-100-mg-50-mg-gm',
  '<section class="product-section"><h3>Composition</h3><div>Each gram contains-<br /> <ul> <li>Aloe Vera (Aloe barbadensis) extract 100 mg and</li> <li>Tea Tree (Melaleuca alternifolia) oil 50 mg.</li> </ul></div></section><section class="product-section"><h3>Indications</h3><div>Acne, Herpes, Psoriasis, Skin inflammation, Allergic skin reaction, Burn, Wound and Scars.</div></section><section class="product-section"><h3>Pharmacology</h3><div>Alofresh gel contains Aloe Vera extract and Tea Tree oil which are very effective in treating acne, psoriasis and skin irritation. Aloe vera has antioxidant, antibacterial and anti-inflammatory properties that promote wound healing, moisturize the skin, prevent aging, reduce inflammation and aid in treating acne. Tea Tree oil contributes glowing skin, helps to eliminate acne and prevents skin infections.</div></section><section class="product-section"><h3>Dosage & Administration</h3><div>Apply this gel as needed, gently massaging it onto the affected skin area 1-2 times daily, or as prescribed by the registered physician</div></section><section class="product-section"><h3>Side Effects</h3><div>No significant side effect has been observed in therapeutic dosage.</div></section>',
