  'Holarant Syrup',
  'holarant-syrup',
  '<section class="product-section"><h3>Composition</h3><div>Per 5 ml of syrup (aqueous extract) contains- <br /> <ul> <li>Holarrhena antidysenterica bark 350 mg</li> <li>Aegle marmelos 100 mg</li> <li>Embelia ribes 35 mg</li> <li>Zingiber officinale 35 mg</li> <li>Piper nigrum 35 mg</li> <li>Piper longum 35 mg</li> <li>Phyllanthus emblica 35 mg</li> <li>Berberis aristata 35 mg</li> <li>Plumbago zeylanica 35 mg</li> <li>Alpinia galanga 35 mg</li> <li>Terminalia chebula 35 mg</li> <li>Terminalia bellirica 35 mg</li> <li>Wrightia tinctoria 35 mg</li> <li>Aconitum heterophyllum 35 mg</li> </ul></div></section><section class="product-section"><h3>Indications</h3><div><ul> <li>Gastrointestinal disorders</li> <li>Diarrhea</li> <li>Dysentery</li> <li>Peptic ulcers</li> <li>Loss of appetite</li> <li>Digestive issues</li> </ul></div></section><section class="product-section"><h3>Pharmacology</h3><div>Holarant Syrup is a potent herbal formulation prepared by blending the extracts of valuable natural ingredients such as Holarrhena antidysenterica bark, Aegle marmelos, Embelia ribes, Zingiber officinale, Piper nigrum, Piper longum, Phyllanthus emblica, Berberis aristata, Plumbago zeylanica, Alpinia galanga, Terminalia chebula, Terminalia bellirica, Wrightia tinctoria, and Aconitum heterophyllum. This unique combination is designed to address various gastrointestinal issues effectively.</div></section><section class="product-section"><h3>Dosage & Administration</h3><div><strong>Adults</strong>: 2-4 teaspoons (10-20 ml) daily, 2-3 times a day, or as directed by a registered healthcare professional.<br /><strong>Children</strong>: 1-2 teaspoons (5-10 ml) daily, 2-3 times a day, or as directed by a registered healthcare professional.<br />Shake well before use. The syrup can be taken with or without water, as advised.</div></section><section class="product-section"><h3>Side Effects</h3><div>No significant side effects have been observed with therapeutic dosage.</div></section>',
